WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.654
An empty pivot cell should not automatically become
zero NULL

00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:11.251
may mean no observation was recorded Zero may mean
the observation

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:16.870
exists and its measured value is zero Those are
different facts

00:00:18.599 --> 00:00:23.020
Before using ELSE zero or COALESCE decide what an
absent source row means for the

00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:24.296
analytical question
